1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,141
You hit Send.

2
00:00:01,141 --> 00:00:03,305
Your words become digital data,

3
00:00:03,305 --> 00:00:04,950
not a floating chat bubble.

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,139
With end-to-end encryption,

5
00:00:07,139 --> 00:00:09,479
your phone locks the contents.

6
00:00:09,479 --> 00:00:13,395
Even the servers carrying it cannot read the message.

7
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:19,425
Data packets cross routers and fiber-optic cables.

8
00:00:19,425 --> 00:00:22,406
Some messages cross entire oceans,

9
00:00:22,406 --> 00:00:24,950
as flashes of light through glass.

10
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,651
Your friend receives it.

11
00:00:26,651 --> 00:00:27,920
The full journey?

12
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,950
Tap the related video below.
